scene('calcine','Calcination of separate powder preparations','calcine','Apply the reported 10 °C/min ramp and 200 °C, 3 h hold to each as-prepared powder separately.', [('Atmosphere','Unreported for synthesis calcination. Do not inherit the air condition of TGA.'),('Specimen boundary','Separate ethanol-, 1-propanol- and 1-butanol-derived powders; no pooled mixture.'),('Unreported','Furnace type, sample loading and cooling schedule.')])
scene('xrd-acquire','Powder diffraction and Scherrer context','xrd','Measure as-prepared and calcined powders using a Bruker AXS D8 Advance with Cu Kα radiation.', [('Specimen boundary','XRD solvent provenance and exact physical-batch links are not explicit.'),('Analysis','The source cites Scherrer analysis but supplies no explicit equation or shape factor.'),('Structure limit','As-prepared bulk phase is unidentified; calcined cubic-CeO2 assignment is not a supplied atomic model.'),('Unreported','Full scan settings and exact instrument geometry.')])
